{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32901","headline":"重阳日寄浙东诸从事 · 李郢","name":"重阳日寄浙东诸从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野人多病门长掩，荒圃重阳菊自开。\n愁里又闻清笛怨，望中难见白衣来。\n元瑜正及从军乐，甯戚谁怜叩角哀。\n红斾纷纷碧江暮，知君醉下望乡台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}